<title>POLAND: Polish ZEW to enter bourse on May 26.</title>
<headline>Polish ZEW to enter bourse on May 26.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish electrodes maker Zaklady Elektrod Weglowych SA (ZEW) will start bourse trade on the main market on May 26, the bourse's president, Wieslaw Rozlucki, said on Friday.</p>
<p>February initial public offering of 800,000 shares in the company, priced at 45 zlotys per share, was oversubscribed.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
